{"id":"lebend","lemma":"lebend","pos":"adj","rank":1814,"glosses":["living","live, alive"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f1/De-lebend.ogg/De-lebend.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Hier kommst du nie lebend heraus.","en":"You'll never make it out here alive.","words":[{"g":"here"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"never, never at all"},null,{"g":"out of"}]},{"text":"Wir haben ihn lebend gefunden.","en":"We found him alive.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"him"},null,{"g":"found, located"}]},{"text":"Ich bin von dort kaum lebend entkommen.","en":"I barely got out of there alive.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"there, yonder"},{"g":"barely, hardly"},null,{"g":"to escape"}]},{"text":"Niemand entkam lebend.","en":"No one escaped alive.","words":[{"g":"nobody, no one"},{"g":"to escape","l":"entkommen"},null]},{"text":"Hier kommt niemand lebend heraus.","en":"Nobody's getting out of here alive.","words":[{"g":"here"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"nobody, no one"},null,{"g":"out of"}]}]}